<title>ESTONIA: KALEV SEES 30 MLN KROON YR PROFIT.</title>
<headline>KALEV SEES 30 MLN KROON YR PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kalev confectionary said on Wednesday that its profit forecast for 1997 was 30 million kroons and its turnover forecast 400 million kroons.</p>
<p>The company said in a statment that it expects 20 million kroons profit from production activities and 10 million kroons from the sale of real estate.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9201/2 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
